	_MACRO_TALKMSG('dialogue_t02', '12-msg_t02_heroine_06_2', '{0,1,0,0}, since you’re a novice Trainer,\nyou won’t be able to buy many kinds of merchandise.\rBut you should buy some Poké Balls and some\nRepels to start with.', 1, 1)
