	_MACRO_TALKMSG('dialogue_t02', '12-msg_t02_hero_06_2', '{0,1,0,0}, since you’re a rookie Trainer,\nyou won’t be able to buy very much stuff.\rYou can buy some Poké Balls and some\nRepels to get you started though!', 1)
